# Platform SSH hardening — managed by Ansible
Port {{ platform_ssh_port }}
Protocol 2
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd no
ClientAliveInterval 300
ClientAliveCountMax 2
MaxAuthTries 3
AllowUsers {{ platform_allow_users | join(' ') }}
